  <div class="accordion__content">
    <div class="accordion__body">
      <h3><span style="margin-right: 0.4rem;">&#128065;&#65039;</span> Experience It</h3>
<p>Every lesson ends with an Experience It activity: one work to look at or listen to closely, and three prompts that ask you to notice something specific. These are practice for the kind of attention the whole course depends on.</p>
<ul>
<li>Spend a few quiet minutes with the work before you read the prompts</li>
<li>Jot your answers down; a sentence or two each is plenty</li>
<li>Come back to the work after the unit and see what has changed in how you look</li>
</ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="accordion__item">
  <button class="accordion__header" aria-expanded="false" type="button">
    <span class="accordion__number">3</span>
