  <div class="accordion__content">
    <div class="accordion__body">
      <h3><span style="margin-right: 0.4rem;">&#128269;</span> Critic's Practice</h3>
<p>Three units (Being a Critic of the Arts, Literature, and Photography) include a Critic's Practice exercise. Each gives you one work and walks you through writing about it in three steps: describe what is there, interpret what it means, and evaluate how well it succeeds. They prepare you for the Final Paper.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

