  <div class="accordion__content">
    <div class="accordion__body">
      <h3><span style="margin-right: 0.4rem;">&#9997;&#65039;</span> Final Paper</h3>
<p>The course ends with a Final Paper: a critical analysis of one work of art of your choice from any unit. You will describe it, interpret it, and evaluate it, using what you have learned about form, subject matter, and the values a work reveals. The assignment page explains the requirements.</p>
